@startuml
' Report 4: supporting interaction
title GROWTH-NOTIFICATION - Background growth notification
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #202020
 LifeLineBorderColor #777777
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor #202020
 ActorBackgroundColor white
 ActorBorderColor #202020
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor #444444
 ReferenceBackgroundColor white
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
participant "ShrimpSizeService" as S
participant "NotificationsService" as N
participant "PrismaService" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
activate S
note over S
Continuation of a task already started by the request.
It does not delay the user confirmation.
end note
S -> P : 1. Load pond and recipient context
activate P
P -> DB : 2. Load pond and recipient context
activate DB
DB -->> P : 3. Farm, owner, staff and recorder
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 4. Farm, owner, staff and recorder
deactivate P
opt 4.1 Recipients exist
S -> S : 4.1.1. Analyze current feed conversion
activate S
S -->> S : 4.1.2. Feed conversion or unavailable
deactivate S
note over S
Classify growth, survival and feed conversion.
end note
S -> N : 4.1.3. Create and deliver observation notification
activate N
' ref-target: NOTIFICATION-DELIVERY
ref over N : 4.1.4. Save and deliver notifications\n(NOTIFICATION-DELIVERY)
N -->> S : 4.1.5. Created notifications
deactivate N
end
deactivate S
